### 记录一次浏览：JSON 请求体，使用新闻 ID
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/add
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"newsId": 1}

### 分页获取浏览历史：同一新闻只返回最近一次浏览
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/list?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 按新闻 ID 删除：清除当前用户对该新闻的全部浏览记录
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/delete/1
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 清空当前用户全部浏览历史，重复调用仍成功
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/clear
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 未携带令牌：HTTP 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/list

### 非法分页参数：HTTP 422
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/history/list?page=0&pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer <token>
